==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|mount a horse foaled by an acorn|ride a horse foaled of an acorn}}

===Etymology===
An allusion to the oak used to construct the gallows.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-ride a horse foaled by an acorn.ogg|a=AU}}

